+/*
+ * IBM "Carolina" PReP board: Power Series 830/850 (6050/6070), RS/6000 7248-43P
+ *
+ * Built to run the original IBM firmware (P93H1904.IMG) and
+ * OS/2 Warp, PowerPC Edition.
